WEBVTT

NOTE Kinage — How Kinage works. English narration, timed to the video (63.47 s).

1
00:00:08.910 --> 00:00:12.630
Don’t worry, all of this now lives
in one place on your Kinage app.

2
00:00:12.910 --> 00:00:14.783
To get started, connect your email.

3
00:00:14.850 --> 00:00:17.570
I will find every bill that arrives there.

4
00:00:18.250 --> 00:00:20.630
Every email is checked for scams too.

5
00:00:21.350 --> 00:00:25.060
Everything you need to see
lands on one screen.

6
00:00:26.160 --> 00:00:29.610
Open any bill to see
what looks unusual and why.

7
00:00:30.310 --> 00:00:32.013
Your email connection is read-only.

8
00:00:32.080 --> 00:00:34.300
You sign in on Google’s own screen.

9
00:00:34.710 --> 00:00:35.823
Now connect your bank.

10
00:00:35.890 --> 00:00:39.100
Plaid makes the connection
between your bank and Kinage.

11
00:00:40.020 --> 00:00:41.813
Your bank sign-in goes through Plaid.

12
00:00:41.880 --> 00:00:44.050
I never see your password,
I cannot move money,

13
00:00:44.050 --> 00:00:46.160
and you can disconnect whenever you want.

14
00:00:46.750 --> 00:00:48.113
Once your bank is connected,

15
00:00:48.180 --> 00:00:50.393
I match each bill
to the payment that cleared,

16
00:00:50.460 --> 00:00:54.690
catch refunds, and keep every transaction
in one place.

17
00:00:55.400 --> 00:00:59.240
And you can invite people you trust,
so you are not doing this alone.

18
00:00:59.880 --> 00:01:02.650
Whenever you are ready, get started below.
